{"text": " If you want to increase your height, start doing these three exercises. After 30 days, people will start noticing and say, Bro, you actually look taller! 1. Cobra stretch Lie on your stomach, lift your chest up and hold the position for 30-40 seconds. Because we spend so much time looking at our phones, our spine gets compressed. This stretch opens it up and improves your posture. 2. Tadasana Palm tree pose Raise both hands up in the air and lift your heels. Stretch your whole body like someone is pulling you upward. This straightens your spine and makes you look instantly taller. 3. Masai jump Jump straight up with full power without bending your knees and land softly. This strengthens your legs and strongly supports height growth. Now, listen to one brutal truth. If your age is over 21, naturally increasing your height becomes very difficult. But by fixing your posture, you can easily look 1-2 inches taller.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.94, "text": " If you want to increase your height, start doing these three exercises.", "tokens": [50364, 759, 291, 528, 281, 3488, 428, 6681, 11, 722, 884, 613, 1045, 11900, 13, 50542], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.1361160413593265, "compression_ratio": 1.63125, "no_speech_prob": 0.006191240157932043, "words": [{"word": " If", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.08, "probability": 0.904296875}, {"word": " you", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.18, "probability": 0.99755859375}, {"word": " want", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.96435546875}, {"word": " to", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.38, "probability": 0.98876953125}, {"word": " increase", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.68, "probability": 0.99658203125}, {"word": " your", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.88, "probability": 0.9931640625}, {"word": " height,", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.16, "probability": 0.9931640625}, {"word": " start", "start": 1.36, "end": 1.56, "probability": 0.99462890625}, {"word": " doing", "start": 1.56, "end": 1.84, "probability": 0.993652343